  "ingredients": [
    "6 large egg",
    "1 tablespoon heavy cream",
    "4 slice cooked bacon (chopped)",
    "1 cup spinach (chopped)",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "5 ounce breakfast sausage (cooked)",
    "3 ounce cheddar cheese (sliced)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all of the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-eggwiches/#wprm-recipe-54215-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Keto-Eggwiches-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, combine the eggs, heavy cream, chopped bacon, chopped spinach, salt, and pepper. Mix together until everything is combined well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-eggwiches/#wprm-recipe-54215-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Keto-Eggwiches-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan over medium heat, add oil and an egg ring. This will help to create a perfect circle. If your breakfast sausage is loose, add the breakfast sausage to the ring and allow it to cook, flipping as needed until cooked through. Set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-eggwiches/#wprm-recipe-54215-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Keto-Eggwiches-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the egg mixture into the egg ring until it gets full. Let this cook for about 2 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-eggwiches/#wprm-recipe-54215-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Keto-Eggwiches-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the egg ring and flip. Let the other side cook for about 1-2 minutes. Repeat this until all of the egg mixture is gone.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-eggwiches/#wprm-recipe-54215-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Keto-Eggwiches-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "On top of an egg circle, add the cooked breakfast sausage and a slice of cheese. Top with another egg circle.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-eggwiches/#wprm-recipe-54215-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Keto-Eggwiches-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve immediately and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-eggwiches/#wprm-recipe-54215-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
